   "body": "### Metrics stay enabled after bind failure\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`enableMetrics()` runs before the Micrometer binders and is not turned off when registration fails. The client then keeps enqueueing connection times with no gauge calling `getTime()`, so the unbounded `times` queue this change addresses can still grow for the lifetime of the `Client`.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: b0fec879-ef05-40be-9739-0cb0ec639ee8 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nclient-v2/src/main/java/com/clickhouse/client/api/internal/HttpAPIClientHelper.java#L299-L311\nclient-v2/src/main/java/com/clickhouse/client/api/internal/HttpAPIClientHelper.java#L1387-L1403\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`client-v2/src/main/java/com/clickhouse/client/api/internal/HttpAPIClientHelper.java#L1387-L1403`](https://github.com/ClickHouse/clickhouse-java/blob/32c65d7b606180523a2520e338bfa0f79e0cbfd1/client-v2/src/main/java/com/clickhouse/client/api/internal/HttpAPIClientHelper.java#L1387-L1403)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a><